---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../../site.config.mjs';
import { url } from '../lib';
const analyticsEnabled =
  site.analyticsId !== 'G-XXXXXXXXXX' && /^G-[A-Z0-9]+$/.test(site.analyticsId);
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Encrypted Cat Games"
  description="How the Encrypted Cat Games website handles contact messages, optional analytics, and third-party services."
>
  <article class="container article legal">
    <header class="article-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Your privacy.</h1>
      <p>Website privacy policy · Updated October 14, 2026</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This policy describes how Encrypted Cat Games (Encrypted Cat / 0xKOT)
        handles information through this website. For privacy questions or
        requests, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Scope</h2>
      <p>
        This policy covers the studio website, contact pages, optional website
        analytics, and links or embeds used here. Games running on itch.io are
        also subject to itch.io’s privacy policy and the game’s own data
        practices.
      </p>
      {!site.nativePrivacyConfirmed && (
        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Native game releases</strong>
          <p>
            Privacy disclosures for future iPhone and iPad releases will be
            added here before those releases. The website policy does not yet
            describe native game data collection.
          </p>
        </div>
      )}
      <h2>Contact and support messages</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact us, we receive the email address, message, game
        selection, topic, and any information you choose to share. We use this
        information to reply, troubleshoot issues, and manage the enquiry.
        Please do not send passwords, payment information, or sensitive personal
        data.
      </p>
      {site.formEndpoint ? (
        <p>
          The contact form uses Formspree to process submissions and forward
          them to our support inbox. Formspree may process technical information
          for delivery and spam prevention. See{' '}
          <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/">
            Formspree’s privacy policy
          </a>
          . Our inbox is provided by Gmail.
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>
          The contact form currently prepares an email draft locally, with a
          link to open your email app. The website does not upload your draft.
          Sending it from your email app delivers it to our Gmail inbox under
          your email provider’s practices.
        </p>
      )}
      <p>
        We keep enquiry information while it is needed to respond and follow up.
        You can request deletion by contacting us; some information may need to
        be retained to meet legal obligations.
      </p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This static website is hosted through GitHub Pages. GitHub may process
        connection information, including IP addresses, for security and service
        operation. See{' '}
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
          GitHub’s privacy statement
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        {analyticsEnabled
          ? 'Google Analytics is configured on this website. It loads only if you accept optional analytics.'
          : 'Google Analytics is currently disabled. The website contains a placeholder configuration that does not load Google Analytics.'}
      </p>
      <p>
        When enabled and accepted, Google Analytics measures page visits and
        usage, including browser and device information. It may store analytics
        cookies. Advertising features are disabled in our configuration, and
        contact form contents are not sent as analytics events. See{' '}
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">
          Google’s privacy policy
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <p>
        You may decline optional analytics or change your choice using{' '}
        <button class="inline-button" type="button" data-privacy-settings>
          Privacy settings
        </button>
        . Your preference is stored locally in your browser. Declining prevents
        analytics from loading. If you withdraw consent, the site stops
        analytics and attempts to remove its analytics cookies from this domain.
      </p>
      <h2>Third-party content and links</h2>
      <p>
        Game widgets connect to itch.io only when you choose “Load game widget.”
        That service may then process connection information or use cookies
        under{' '}
        <a href="https://itch.io/docs/legal/privacy-policy">
          itch.io’s privacy policy
        </a>
        . Devlog images are hosted with this site. Video links and community
        links open external services; their own privacy policies apply when you
        visit them.
      </p>
      <h2>Local storage and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This website stores your analytics preference in local storage when you
        make a choice. We do not use a website account system. Optional
        analytics cookies and third-party widget cookies depend on the features
        you choose to load. Your browser lets you clear stored preferences and
        cookies.
      </p>
      <h2>Your requests</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask about information you have sent us, request correction or
        deletion, or raise a privacy concern by emailing{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Depending on where
        you live, you may have additional rights under applicable privacy law.
      </p>
      <h2>Policy updates</h2>
      <p>
        We will update this page when website services or data practices change.
        Native game disclosures will identify the relevant game and describe its
        actual data practices before App Store release.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="text-link" href={url('contact/')}>
          Contact Encrypted Cat Games <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
